<title>FRANCE: Suez -525 mln Ffr cap gain from Facto sale.</title>
<headline>Suez -525 mln Ffr cap gain from Facto sale.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>French holding company Compagnie de Suez said in a statement on Friday the April 2 sale of its 50 percent stake in Facto Holdings to Heller International Group would result in a consolidated capital gain in its 1997 accounts of 525 million francs.</p>
<p>Suez said in February it had expected a consolidated capital gain of &quot;more than 500 million francs&quot;.</p>
<p>The sale gives Heller total control of Facto which had been a 50/50 joint venture with Suez since 1996.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
